{"id":"425854","name":"香菇瘦肉汤豆皮","author":"笑笑昵","authorId":"10878013","desc":"","cover":"images/425854/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪瘦肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"味极鲜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇用温水泡发。","img":"images/425854/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡好的香菇切成丝。","img":"images/425854/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"瘦肉切丝切片都行。","img":"images/425854/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把切好的瘦肉加淀粉和味极鲜抓匀。","img":"images/425854/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再放入一勺食用油拌匀。","img":"images/425854/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"就个就是湖北豆皮。","img":"images/425854/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把豆皮切粗丝。","img":"images/425854/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"青菜洗净切段。","img":"images/425854/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中放油，放入瘦肉滑散。","img":"images/425854/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入香菇丝炒一会，炒出香味。","img":"images/425854/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量的水煮开。","img":"images/425854/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入味极鲜。","img":"images/425854/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入一勺蚝油。","img":"images/425854/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入豆皮煮两分钟。","img":"images/425854/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入青菜。","img":"images/425854/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入胡椒粉。","img":"images/425854/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入盐调味。","img":"images/425854/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放入鸡精，关火。","img":"images/425854/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/425854/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}